	(text "AMP_RAW can reach 10 V during a range change: R125 and D22 limit the driver input.\nU29 and D22 run from VDRV: 1.091 x VREF = 2.73 V at the output of U28 (R127, R124),\nabout 2.68 V behind R129 (calculated), which keeps the buffer stable into C88. While\nthe buffer is supplied the converter input cannot pass REF + 0.25 V (calculated;\nrating REF + 0.3 V) and no clamp current flows into VREF. U29: Sallen-Key, 40 kHz,\nQ = 0.74. R130 and C90 as the converter input needs. After a range change the chain\nneeds 45 us to 0.1 % of range and 65 us to 1 LSB (simulated): 7 samples are flagged.\n\nU30: 3-wire CS mode, DIN high. CONVST and SCLK come from the acquisition state machine\n(PIO block 0, GP20 and GP19). CONVST rising edge = sampling instant; high for at least\n710 ns (108 clocks of 150 MHz), then 16 SCLK cycles of 15 MHz or less, 20 ns quiet\nbefore the next edge. One capacitor at the REF pin: C89 (10 uF min at REF) behind R131.\nRN5 keeps the current into DVDD at 6 mA to 10 mA peak, 11.3 mA at tolerance, when the\ncontroller drives the lines while +3V3_C is off (calculated)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 127 133.35 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "93ec7704-894d-5bbb-a5ef-53b5f181a554")
	)
	(text "SH1, MP3: two-piece shield can over the multiplexer, the\namplifier, the converter and the shunts of ranges 0 to 2.\nThe frame is soldered with the parts; the cover is snapped\non after cleaning and comes off for probing."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 213.36 21.59 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "98311a7f-02e5-57d3-9ebc-405b09cb969b")
	)
	(text "U27: G = 1 + 9.9 k / R123 = 19.93. Its reference pin stands\nat 50 mV (R121, R122, U26): zero current reads about 1313\ncodes; the converter is at full scale with 122.9 mV across\nthe shunt. Input filter C77 220 pF, C76 = C75 22 pF:\nabout 0.12 us with the multiplexer in front (calculated)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 29.21 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c30a3fa8-8ff5-5173-ae90-a179c87763dc")
	)
